      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "From the initial recommendation through proposal & installation, this company has communicated effectively. Their price was very competitive but not a major determining factor in our decision. We could have easily gone with a more elaborate (and costly) system but their sales representative explained what little advantage that would give us considering our circumstances & location. I had an issue with their sub contractor installing a new main switch of insignificant value & charging $200 but Greenlight were most understanding & resolved the issue to my satisfaction. We were advised of installation dates well in advance & received clear communication with each step of the process.",
