      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Research process was hard but made easier by SolarQuotes site with all the information available. The sales process with the preferred supplier was easy, effective, prompt and they were responsive to all my questions. What was promised was delivered and installed. The installation was seamless except for a storm which meant that installers had to come back next day and finish. No problems for them. This really reflected well on the company. Recommend them highly. Some additional costs increased the total costs such as inverter had to be placed in garage or had to have a awning as it was facing west (govt requirement). That meant extra cabling  to garage. Inverter placement was not made clear initially but after questioning, based on information read I was able to understand the cost involved.",
