      "review_description": "Found these guys at the home show. They called & arranged an onsite quote for a 6.6 kw system.I went with this company because of their honesty & they were designing a system that would suit my needs.I actually called them about installing a battery & solar system to effectively neutralize my electricity bill.I was told that origin energy had a 21 cent feed in tariff & just a solar system producing enough surplus powerwould pay for the electricity I purchased as well as the daily charge. This option would be far cheaper than a battery system.I also need the new system to run along side of my old 2Kw systemA week later & the New 6.6 Kw system is running & I couldn't be happier as I earned $10 per day FIT for the first 2 days of operation.They were prompt & showed up when they said they would & didn't leave any mess.",
